00:05:38.064 --> 00:05:40.800
<v Host>It means great joy, or delight.

00:05:41.399 --> 00:05:53.567
<v Slow>健大高崎は、今回が初めての決勝進出でしたが、優勝まであと一歩、届きませんでした。

00:05:54.367 --> 00:06:00.656
<v Host>Kendai Takasaki reached the final for the first time, but fell one step short of the title.

